                                "sense_id": "43db20f7-0234-3e42-9145-9a8934307f0c",
                                "text": "‘Of the hydropick tumour there is now very little appearance: the asthma is much less troublesome, and seems to remit something day after day.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d3bb9e03-b8c7-3357-afab-f907a01c01cd",
